# Workshop

The tower has 3 types of upgrades: Attack, Defense and Utility. These upgrades can be bought between rounds with Coins and during rounds with cash. Upgrades bought with coins are permanent while upgrades bought with cash will reset each round.

Ultimate Weapons unlocks and upgrades can also be purchased through the workshop menu.

Mechanic: Damage
Type: Workshop
Category: Attack
Aliases: dmg
Definition: Damage is the base value used to determine how much each tower projectile deals to enemies. It is the foundational stat for tower projectiles, land mines, and Ultimate Weapons that scale from tower damage.
Formula:
Displayed Damage = Workshop × Lab × Damage Card × (1 + Relics) × (1 + Cannon Module %) × Enhancements × Perk1 + Berserker2
No rounding is applied at any stage.
Perk1 = (1 + 0.15 × Quantity) × (1 + Standard Perk Bonus).
Berserker adds stored bonus damage up to a +700% cap (8× base).
Workshop:
Unlocked at the start of the game.
Maximum of 6000 levels.
Damage can be increased using cards, relics, modules, and Workshop Enhancements.
Enhancements: Damage Enhancement: 400 upgrades available.
Labs:
Damage Lab: Unlocks in Milestones at Tier 1. Increases per-level increment and maximum Workshop Damage.
Super Tower Bonus Lab: Unlocks in Milestones at Tier 8 Wave 300. Increases the multiplier on the Super Tower card. Has 30 levels.
Cards: Damage: Common card. Levels 1-7: x1.5, x2, x2.4, x2.8, x3.2, x3.6, x4.
Masteries: Damage+: Damage card mastery. Unlock + levels 1-9: x1.4, x1.8, x2.2, x2.6, x3, x3.4, x3.8, x4.2, x4.6, x5.
Modules:
Cannon category.
Unique modules: Amplifying Strike. Epic: Killing a Boss or Elite enemy increases Tower damage by 5x for 5 seconds. Legendary: Killing a Boss or Elite enemy increases Tower damage by 5x for 11 seconds. Mythic: Killing a Boss or Elite enemy increases Tower damage by 5x for 18 seconds. Ancestral: Killing a Boss or Elite enemy increases Tower damage by 5x for 26 seconds. Project Funding. Epic: Tower damage is multiplied by 12.5% of the number of digits in your current cash. Legendary: Tower damage is multiplied by 25% of the number of digits in your current cash. Mythic: Tower damage is multiplied by 50% of the number of digits in your current cash. Ancestral: Tower damage is multiplied by 100% of the number of digits in your current cash.
Substats: None.
Relics: Rare: 12 relics at 2%; Rare: 1 relic at 3%; Epic: 10 relics at 5%; Legendary: 2 relics at 10%.
Vault:
Harmony: Damage Cap Slider (1 unlock).
Power: 5% Damage (3 upgrades).
Perks:
x1.15 Damage (qty 5).
x1.50 Tower Damage, but Bosses Have 8x Health (qty 1).
Footguns:
Berserker adds stored bonus damage and is not a pure multiplier.
Glass Cannon is more about crowd control than total damage.

Mechanic: Attack Speed
Type: Workshop
Category: Attack
Aliases: aspd; as
Definition:
Attack Speed controls how many projectiles the tower fires and also increases projectile travel speed before Light Speed Shots is unlocked. At low values it is close to shots per second, but the stat becomes less linear at higher values and remains under analysis after the V27 performance changes.
Once Light Speed Shots is completed, normal tower projectiles travel instantly to their target and no longer gain travel speed from Attack Speed.
Formula:
Displayed Attack Speed = (Workshop × Lab × Card + Module Sub Effect) × Enhancement
No rounding is applied at any stage.
Workshop:
Unlocked at the start of the game.
99 workshop levels.
Base value 1.00; each level adds 0.05 for 5.95 total before other multipliers.
Enhancements: Attack Speed Enhancement: 75 upgrades available.
Labs:
Attack Speed Lab: Unlocks in Milestones at Tier 1 Wave 30. Increases the increment and maximum workshop value.
Light Speed Shots: Unlocks in Milestones at Tier 7 Wave 10. Makes tower projectiles travel instantly after they are fired.
Cards: Attack Speed: Common card. Levels 1-7: x1.25, x1.4, x1.55, x1.7, x1.85, x2, x2.15.
Masteries: Attack Speed+: Attack Speed card mastery. Unlock + levels 1-9: x1.03, x1.06, x1.09, x1.12, x1.15, x1.18, x1.21, x1.24, x1.27, x1.3.
Modules:
Cannon category.
Unique modules: Restorative Bonus. Epic: Packages grant a 50% attack speed boost for 15 seconds, decaying for 60 seconds. Legendary: Packages grant a 50% attack speed boost for 20 seconds, decaying for 60 seconds. Mythic: Packages grant a 50% attack speed boost for 25 seconds, decaying for 60 seconds. Ancestral: Packages grant a 50% attack speed boost for 30 seconds, decaying for 60 seconds.
Substats: Cannon Attack Speed: Common +0.3; Rare +0.5; Epic +0.7; Legendary +1; Mythic +3; Ancestral +5.
Relics: Rare: 3 relics at 1%; Epic: 3 relics at 2%.
Vault: Power: 5% Attack Speed (3 upgrades).
Perks: None.
Footguns:
High Attack Speed is not a clean shots-per-second readout.
Light Speed Shots changes projectile travel behavior, so pre-LSS and post-LSS comparisons are not one-to-one.

