Mechanic: Health
Type: Workshop
Category: Defense
Aliases: hp
Definition: Health is the tower's maximum health pool. It is the base defensive stat that other survivability systems build on.
Formula:
Approximate eHP = (Health + Defense Absolute) / (1 - Defense %)
